<title>USA: Stone Street Bancorp Inc increases qtly div.</title>
<headline>Stone Street Bancorp Inc increases qtly div.</headline>
<dateline>MOCKSVILLE, N.C. 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stone Street Bancorp Inc said it increased its quarterly dividend to $0.1125 per share from $0.11 per share.</p>
<p>In addition to the prior regular quarterly dividend of $0.11 per share, the company also paid a special dividend of $0.11 per share.</p>
<p>The latest dividend will be paid on March 27 to shareholders of record on March 17.</p>
